sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P as Player's browser
    participant W as Website
    participant D as Discord
    participant API as API
    P->>W: GET /sign-in
    W-->>P: Redirect to Discord, asking for identify and guilds
    P->>D: Consent screen
    alt Player denies
        D-->>P: Return to /signin-discord, access denied
        P->>W: /signin-discord
        W-->>P: Redirect to /sign-in/failed?reason=denied, with a retry
    else Player authorizes
        D-->>P: Return to /signin-discord with a code
        P->>W: /signin-discord with the code and state
        W->>D: Exchange the code, read the Discord identity
        alt Exchange or state check fails
            W-->>P: Redirect to /sign-in/failed?reason=failed, with a retry
        else Identity read
            W->>API: POST /internal/identity/discord-sign-in with the website key
            API-->>W: The local user id, the same on every sign-in
            W->>D: GET /users/@me/guilds with the sign-in token
            W->>API: Find the communities of those servers
            W->>API: Get the player's pending character claims
            W-->>P: Set the session cookie (HttpOnly, Secure, SameSite Lax), without keeping the Discord token
            alt Pending claims, or the check failed
                W-->>P: Redirect to /characters/review
            else No pending claims
                W-->>P: Redirect to the requested local page
            end
        end
    end
